{"item_id":"feed:https://ruckauthority.com/gear/goruck-ruck-plates","version_id":"83d8b032d33ced6234a5aed1b0747e0d8ef40599bc34c31ccfdda0a2335d7def","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Relevance and Making the decision, this is a compatibility guide for exercise ballast rather than evidence about equipment for Mammoth's multi-day gear carriage. Credibility and Commercial incentives also require distinguishing manufacturer-listed dimensions and weights from independent measurements: GORUCK supplied gear, and the publisher earns affiliate commissions.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://ruckauthority.com/gear/goruck-rucking-weighted-vest","version_id":"1bfea4744aa6c0e7d0cab66f2dab5f1ebf62446a1865bc0ea1fa90173f673854","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Relevance and Making the decision, three weeks of weighted walking with an exercise vest does not establish a useful connection to carrying competition equipment for days at Mammoth. The review offers specific observations about heat, fit and plate stability, but no backpack integration or endurance-event use; under Commercial incentives, its gifted GORUCK equipment and affiliate commissions also limit its independence.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://ruckauthority.com/gear/goruck-spy-ruck-womens-vest","version_id":"e0d4dbd3ee13e61ecdbe5a8dc134820c71203b73d25026f4ef9cbb1b440b8e24","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Relevance and Making the decision, this fixed-weight vest review concerns ordinary fitness walks and concealment under a jacket, without evidence connecting it to Mammoth gear carriage or conditions. Its several-week fit observations are substantive, but Commercial incentives requires noting the GORUCK-supplied vest and publisher's affiliate commissions.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://ruckauthority.com/guides/goruck-ruck-shuffle-basic-rucker","version_id":"1ee84564c3fae6506fa8596ffdda0ca171a6d702feb3e3991d8d94de996e9bff","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Relevance and Making the decision, this primarily evaluates a training gait and knee-safety claims rather than Mammoth equipment suitability; the Basic Rucker discussion supplies specifications but explicitly lacks documented performance testing. Freshness and novelty recognizes the newly added airborne-shuffle research and corrections, while Commercial incentives requires noting GORUCK affiliate commissions, but neither resolves the scope mismatch.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://ruckauthority.com/guides/best-rucking-books-2026","version_id":"f06c08c3ade5c2178960760c580c92bda32465f8847eac7abf3261e947992775","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Relevance and Making the decision, recreational training books and motivational memoirs fall outside the specified competitor-gear categories. Credibility further limits recommendations based on publisher descriptions and author material rather than evaluated programs; Commercial incentives flags the publisher's affiliate business and GORUCK-supplied review gear elsewhere in its coverage.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://ruckauthority.com/guides/first-30-days-of-rucking","version_id":"e7478e892d0b68e86e3590cf5a6aee352334952687a2aa6cc21c5af1eb937f84","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Relevance and Making the decision, this is a general beginner exercise schedule that explicitly disclaims event preparation, with no substantive equipment evaluation for Mammoth. Its distinction between research and editorial progression is useful under Uncertainty, but does not bring it into scope; Commercial incentives notes the publisher's affiliate commissions and GORUCK-supplied review units.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://ruckauthority.com/guides/how-heavy-should-your-ruck-be","version_id":"9493cd846697b7ce4138fb6d9363ca50e8390becab392ba0cd1b2ad55ab62c63","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Relevance and Making the decision, this chiefly addresses exercise-load selection and progression, rather than equipment performance under Mammoth conditions. The Hyperwear sleeve mention supplies no field testing to establish suitability under Credibility, and Commercial incentives requires noting the publisher's affiliate commissions and GORUCK-supplied review gear.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://ruckauthority.com/guides/what-is-rucking-weighted-walking-explained","version_id":"4e30a87b3843f861ad970752ef7c31a5e66c382cec6a22c681cbd6891698511f","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Relevance and Making the decision, this introductory recreational-fitness explainer does not provide a substantive Mammoth gear assessment. Its incidental pack, vest and plate recommendations lack described comparative testing under Credibility; Commercial incentives also flags affiliate commissions, GORUCK-supplied review units and promotion of a sister site's vest recommendation.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://ruckauthority.com/injuries/rucking-knee-pain","version_id":"efaf546f0140dab528ea219954dc01c47943dd1496c66a140ccf8cf559ce6ede","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Relevance and Making the decision, this is primarily injury-management and rehabilitation guidance, with incidental footwear and accessory suggestions rather than Mammoth gear evidence. Credibility and Uncertainty recognize its explicit limits on treatment and product claims, while Commercial incentives requires noting the publisher's affiliate commissions and GORUCK-supplied review gear.","piece_ids":[]}
